WEBVTT

00:15:58.537 --> 00:16:02.996
You can learn something from looking to
the past. More on that after the break.

00:16:08.787 --> 00:16:10.954
OK, this is going to be a
different kind of ad,

00:16:11.412 --> 00:16:14.496
I play a personal role in selecting
the sponsors for this podcast

00:16:14.829 --> 00:16:16.829
because they all have interesting
cultures of their own.

00:16:17.496 --> 00:16:20.246
Today, we're going inside the
workplace at Morgan Stanley.